Console-based Audio Visualizer for Alsa (MPD and Pulseaudio)

NOTE:
-----
This SlackBuild requires 'iniparser' which was added to 15.0
on Fri Jul 17 00:04:50 UTC 2026 as a requirement for netatalk.
Please ensure your system is up to date with and a
"slackpkg install-new" has been ran prior to attempting to
build.
